===beforeGunfire===
# speaker: Choshu Samurai
HALT!

# speaker: Choshu Samurai
State your allegiance!

# speaker: Masahiro
Inaba Masahiro of the Yodo Domain. I'm here to deliver a message to your commander.

# speaker: Choshu Samurai
Yodo?! You dare threaten the Emperor?! Shogunate scum!!

# speaker: Masahiro
You must let me pass, as this letter will alert of a Shogunate attack on Kyoto.

# speaker: Choshu Samurai
Many merchants and travelers have revealed themselves as spies. Tell me who you are...

# speaker: Choshu Samurai
NOW!!!

# speaker: Masahiro
I must deliver my message, even if it means dying by your hand.
